---
layout: base.njk
title: "Insights"
description: "Short essays from Paul Raff on turning data into insight — active documentation, baselines, and avoiding vanity metrics."
---

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Writing</p>
    <h1>Insights</h1>
    <p class="lead">Short essays on turning data into insight — and avoiding the traps that get in the way.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding-top:1rem">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="post-grid">
      {% for post in collections.posts %}
        <a class="post-card" href="{{ post.url }}">
          {% if post.data.cover %}
            <div class="post-card-media"><img src="{{ post.data.cover }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
          {% endif %}
          <div class="post-card-body">
            <p class="post-meta">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</p>
            <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
            <p class="post-card-desc">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
            <span class="post-card-more">Read more →</span>
          </div>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
